                     </font><br /><font name="Gulim" size="10" shadowx="0" shadowy="0" shadowa="0">목: 말목 (Perissodactyla)
                     </font><br /><font name="Gulim" size="10" shadowx="0" shadowy="0" shadowa="0">과: 말과(말, 당나귀, 얼룩말) (Equidae)</font><br /><font name="Gulim" size="10" shadowx="0" shadowy="0" shadowa="0">속: </font><font name="Gulim" size="10" shadowx="0" shadowy="0" shadowa="0">Equus</font>
                     <br /><font name="Gulim" size="10" shadowx="0" shadowy="0" shadowa="0">종: </font><font name="Gulim" size="10" shadowx="0" shadowy="0" shadowa="0">burchelli</font>
                     <br /><font name="Gulim" size="10" shadowx="0" shadowy="0" shadowa="0">아종: </font><font name="Gulim" size="10" shadowx="0" shadowy="0" shadowa="0">boehmi</font>
